### 3. **AppRouteHostRegistry** — File: `/Users/atulgupta/Documents/repos/.teslasync-parallel/20260615-235425-51116/slot-12/apps/apple/Sources/App/RouteHostRegistry.swift` (Complete file)

**Full API:**

```swift
public struct AppRouteHostRegistry {
    private var providers: [AppRoute: () -> AnyView] = [:]

    public init() {}

    /// REGISTER METHOD SIGNATURE — this is how routes register:
    public mutating func register(_ route: AppRoute, @ViewBuilder _ provider: @escaping () -> some View) {
        providers[route] = { AnyView(provider()) }
    }

    /// RETRIEVAL METHOD:
    public func view(for route: AppRoute) -> AnyView? {
        providers[route]?()
    }

    public var registeredRoutes: Set<AppRoute> {
        Set(providers.keys)
    }
}
```

**Key constraint:** 
- `register()` takes an `AppRoute` (no parameters) and a `@ViewBuilder` closure
- **NO support for passing IDs or route parameters to views**
- The closure has signature `@escaping () -> some View` (takes NO arguments)

